WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.540
Hosting a good party is all about

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.960
good preparation

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.380
good snacks

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.760
good drinks

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.760
good tunes

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.940
But even with good planning, parties can still go pear-shaped.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.880
So make sure you register your party at goodone.org.nz

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.400
The Good One website has heaps of tips

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.940
for making sure your event goes off without a hitch

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:26.460
and by registering, police, fire and noise
control know who to get in touch with if

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.340
there's a problem on the night.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.020
Simply enter the details of your party

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.100
The local police will call for a quick chat about your plans

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.960
and then have a great time.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:38.280
and if things do start to get a bit
hairy

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.640
the police can pop by and help out

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.420
So, whether you're a student, parent

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:45.360
sports club or other - be a great host.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:48.160
Register your party and make sure you have a good one.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:56.280
North Canterbury,  it's now
your turn to have a good one with a

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.000
voucher book jam-packed full of free stuff
and discounts for the first 50 parties

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.760
registered in the Waimakariri

